      "text": "async function fun() {\n    console.log(\"async start\");\n    const response = await p1;\n    return response;\n}\n\n// fun().then((data)=>console.log(data)).catch((err)=>console.log(err));\n\n\nasync function fun2() {\n    const data = await fun();\n    console.log(data);\n    \n}\nfun2();",
